statement:
Canonical derived open restriction and direct-image composition. For every commutative condensed coefficient ring Λ and schemes and maps as in the following Lean statement, {X Y Z X' Y' Z' : Scheme.{u}}
    {f : X ⟶ Y} {g : Y ⟶ Z} {f' : X' ⟶ Y'} {g' : Y' ⟶ Z'}
    {i : X' ⟶ X} {j : Y' ⟶ Y} {a : Z' ⟶ Z}
    [IsOpenImmersion i] [IsOpenImmersion j] [IsOpenImmersion a]
    (sqf : IsPullback i f' f j) (sqg : IsPullback j g' g a) :
    DirectImageRestrictionComposition Λ sqf.toCommSq sqg.toCommSq. The canonical maps and predicates are those of [def-sfb-derived-direct-image-open-coherence-data].

